    4: # Every asset any row of packaging/macos/lima/profiles.env references must
    5: # appear here, or that profile is advertised in the shipped profiles.env and
    6: # then fails to load. The native-arm64 block at the bottom was missing for
    7: # exactly that reason until the native payload joined the release pipeline.
